id: pm-context-5njx
title: Adopt pm CLI 2026.8.7 and protect extension assets during multi-agent merges
description: "Upgrade pm-context's peer/development pm CLI and pm SDK contract plus pm-changelog tooling, regenerate the lockfile, and install the 2026.8.7 extension-asset merge fence so generated extension contents never receive semantic PM merges while .managed-extensions.json retains key-level pm-json merging."
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 0
