estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: "package and lockfile use current pm CLI/SDK 2026.8.7 and current pm-changelog; pm merge install emits extensions/** -merge before the managed-manifest pm-json override; exact 100/100/100 coverage, tests, npm and Bun release gates, privacy patch scan, package dry-run, and changelog check pass; exact-head PR review completes with no unresolved findings; no publication occurs; pm context-usage --format json emits parseable JSON through the real installed CLI; pm validate and pm health --check-only --strict-exit pass"
definition_of_ready: "Canonical checkout is clean on main, no open PR or package item duplicates the work, and installed pm 2026.8.7 is available"
value: Keep agent-generated extension assets and their managed registry safe across concurrent branches
impact: Prevents generated artifacts from being parsed or semantically merged as PM data
outcome: pm-context carries the current SDK contract and canonical extension merge fence
